    "content": "## Weekly lead summary\nEvery Monday morning counts last week's texted-back missed calls and replies from your sheet, adds a row to a Weekly Summary tab and emails you the totals.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Needs the Leads and Replies tabs written by the other two workflows.\n2. Open the Config node and fill in your values; connect the credentials shown on each node.\n3. Activate the workflow.",
